issue_tracker_help_what_is = What is an issue?
issue_tracker_help_what_is_text = An issue is a request, problem, or suggestion. It serves to document problems, suggest improvements, or ask questions.
issue_tracker_help_one_topic = Only one topic per issue!
issue_tracker_help_one_topic_text = Please create a separate issue for each problem. If you have multiple different problems, create multiple issues. This way, individual points can be better tracked and processed.
